 supports auto-negotiation (10/100 Mbps), auto MDI/MDI-X</li>\n                  <li>Fiber Port: 1 × 100Base-FX fiber optic port</li>\n                  <li>Wavelength (fiber): Typical 850 nm / 1310 nm / 1550 nm — depending on fiber type and transceiver module</li>\n                  <li>Cable Support (Copper): Cat-5 (or better) UTP/STP; max. distance ~100 m (twisted-pair segment)</li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p>The UltraNet Fiber Ethernet Media Converter 100Base (Pair) is a reliable and cost-effective solution for extending your network over long distances using fiber-optic cabling. Designed for seamless copper-to-fiber conversion, this pair of media converters supports 10/100Mbps Fast Ethernet, delivering stable, interference-free data transmission for home, office, ISP, CCTV, and enterprise networks.</p><p><br></p><p>With support for 100Base-TX to 100Base-FX, the UltraNet converter ensures smooth connectivity between RJ45 Ethernet devices and fiber backbone networks. Its plug-and-play design, auto-negotiation, and built-in diagnostics make installation quick and hassle-free. Ideal for long-distance links, FTTH/FTTB setups, and noise-free communication, this UltraNet media converter pair is one of the most dependable solutions available in Bangladesh.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Supports IEEE 802.3 / 802.3u Fast Ethernet standards</li><li>Converts 10/100Base-TX (RJ45) to 100Base-FX (Fiber)</li><li>Auto-negotiation for 10/100Mbps and Full/Half-Duplex</li><li>Auto MDI/MDI-X crossover on RJ45 port</li><li>Stable fiber transmission up to multiple kilometers (depending on SM/MM type)</li><li>LED indicators for Power, TX, RX &amp; Link status</li><li>Compact metal casing for durability and heat dissipation</li><li>Plug-and-play operation — no configuration required</li><li>Ideal for long-distance networking, CCTV, ISP backbone &amp; FTTH networks</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/otech-10g-sfp-case-ot-sfc10ge-fiber-media-converter\"> OTECH 10G SFP+ Case OT-SFC10GE Fiber Media Converter</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">6,000৳</span> \n                                <span class=\"price-old\">6,800৳</span> \n                                                         \n                        </p>                      \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                    \n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>   \n    </div>\n            <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-footer text-center\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-view-compare btn-primary\" id=\"compatibility-table-full\">View Details</button>\n        </div>    \n    </div>\n           \n\n              </div>\n   